## 1. Executive summary

The governance design has two independent barriers:

1. **Barrier 1 — automatic Git deployment from `main` is removed** by `vercel.json` → `git.deploymentEnabled: {"main": false}`. Documented semantics: *"Specify branches that should not trigger a deployment upon commits. By default, any unspecified branch is set to `true`."* (https://vercel.com/docs/project-configuration/git-configuration). Feature branches and pull requests keep previewing.
2. **Barrier 2 — deployment creation is separated from production promotion.** The Vercel project setting *Production → Branch Tracking → Auto-assign Custom Production Domains* is turned off, so every production build becomes **Staged** and cannot take `app.zes.codes`. The owner promotes manually in the Vercel Dashboard (documented flow: https://vercel.com/docs/deployments/promoting-a-deployment → "Staging and promoting a production deployment").

The release path between the barriers is a `workflow_dispatch` GitHub Actions workflow with two jobs: **Job A (Validate)** — no production credentials, no environment, verifies owner actor, dispatch ref, full SHA, main ancestry, CI status and runs the repo gates; **Job B (Staged deployment)** — the only job with the `production` Environment and the Vercel credentials, revalidates the SHA, builds with `vercel pull` + `vercel build --prod`, deploys with `vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod`, waits for `READY`, verifies that **production was not touched**, runs health/smoke checks on the staged deployment URL, and prints the mandated summary. **It never promotes** — there is no `vercel promote`, `vercel rollback`, `vercel alias assign` or `vercel redeploy` command anywhere in the file (verified by static scan).

**Single-owner model respected:** no `required_reviewers`, no `prevent_self_review`, no second-approver requirement. The GitHub Environment is a **secrets boundary and deployment-history mechanism only** — it does **not** enforce human approval, and this report does not claim that it does. The explicit `workflow_dispatch` is the release decision; the manual Vercel promotion is the second decision.

